---
For each product kind with a lifecycle, how many entities have each status.

Usage: specforge product bulk-status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the project
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
